          "quote": "In American culture, when\nyou receive a compliment,\nit's very natural for\nyou to say thank you.\nFor example, your\nChinese is very good.\nYou say, thank you.\nYour English is good.\nThank you.",
          "topic": "美国文化中接受赞美的自然回应",
          "claim": "讲者以美国文化为例，说明收到赞美时很自然会说谢谢，例如别人说你的中文很好，你回答谢谢。",
