          "quote": "So the comments--\nit really depends\non the student's performance.\nIt can be as simple\nas, you know, pay\nattention to the\nfollowing pronunciations.\nIt can be a little\nbit more elaborated.\nFor example, think\nabout, how are you\ngoing to deal with\ncompliments in Chinese?",
          "topic": "评论内容取决于学生表现",
          "claim": "讲者表示评论内容取决于学生的表现，可以简单到提醒注意某些发音，也可以更详细，例如思考如何用中文应对赞美。",
          "evidence_indices": [
