            78,
            79,
            80
          ],
          "attribution": "HAOHSIANG LIAO",
          "importance": "core",
          "attribution_start": 0,
          "attribution_end": 14
        },
        {
          "id": "F1_7",
          "source_id": "part1",
          "source_sha256": "4b1b09addb5ad3cab6dc885fb4f0a805fede65b2eecc8976b232e180a427edb9",
          "start": 1873,
          "end": 2199,
          "quote": "So if the student's performance\nin class is from his L1,\nwe will encourage\nthem and give them\nthe feedback by\nthinking about, how\ndo you deal with compliments\nin Chinese culture,\naccording to a textbook\nwhere everything\nis based on the materials\nwe cover in class?\nSo students can know\nthis is something\nthat they can work on.",
          "topic": "针对L1表现的反馈方式",
          "claim": "讲者表示如果学生的课堂表现来自其母语（L1），会鼓励他们，并根据课堂上涵盖的教材内容，从如何在中国文化中应对赞美的角度给予反馈，让学生知道这是可以努力的方向。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            81,
