          "quote": "HAOHSIANG LIAO: Whenever you\nhave interaction with people,\nyou leave impressions.\nYou are evaluated.\nWe want to give evaluation to\nour students each performance.\nThat means each class.\nis we are convinced\nthat, as long as students\nare persistent and consistent\nin their efforts to\ntake this course,\nthey can demonstrate very\ngood skills in Chinese.\nSo because of those two reasons,\nwe adopt a daily grading system\nhere.",
          "topic": "日常评分系统的两个理由",
          "claim": "讲者提出采用日常评分系统的两个理由：一是与人互动会留下印象并受到评价，因此希望每次表现（即每节课）都给学生评价；二是讲者相信只要学生坚持且持续努力修读该课程，就能展现很好的中文技能。",
