          "start": 684,
          "end": 984,
          "quote": "We usually do written feedback.\nSo we use an online-- we have\na website called Engrade.\nSo besides entering grades,\nyou can also leave comments\nto each student privately.\nSo each student, as\nlong as they get access\ninto their website\nto their account,\nthey will read the comments\nfrom the instructor.",
          "topic": "通过Engrade网站提供书面反馈",
          "claim": "讲者表示通常使用书面反馈，通过一个名为Engrade的网站，除了录入成绩外，还可以私下给每位学生留言；学生只要登录自己的账户就能读到教师的评论。",
